---
ticker: "{{ ticker }}"
type: trading-position
status: "{{ status }}"
currency: "{{ currency }}"
{% if position -%}
direction: "{{ position.direction }}"
shares: {{ position.shares }}
avg_cost: {{ position.avg_cost }}
cost_basis: {{ position.cost_basis }}
{% if position.stop_loss is not none %}stop_loss: {{ position.stop_loss }}
{% endif -%}
{% if position.unrealized_pnl is not none %}unrealized_pnl: {{ position.unrealized_pnl }}
{% endif -%}
{% endif -%}
realized_pnl: {{ realized }}
{% if strategy -%}
strategy: "{{ strategy }}"
{% endif -%}
first_trade: "{{ first_trade }}"
last_trade: "{{ last_trade }}"
fills: {{ fills | length }}
tags:
  - trading
  - position
{% for t in tags %}  - "{{ t }}"
{% endfor -%}
---

# {{ ticker }} — {{ status | capitalize }}

{% if position -%}
## Open position

- **Side:** {{ position.direction }} {{ position.shares | num }}
- **Avg cost:** {{ position.avg_cost | money(currency) }} (breakeven incl. fees {{ position.breakeven_price | money(currency) }})
- **Cost basis:** {{ position.cost_basis | money(currency) }}
- **Stop:** {{ position.stop_loss | money(currency) if position.stop_loss is not none else "not set" }}
{% if position.current_price is not none -%}
- **Last:** {{ position.current_price | money(currency) }} ({{ position.price_source }}, {{ (position.price_as_of or "")[:10] }}) → unrealized {{ position.unrealized_pnl | money(currency) }} ({{ "%.1f" | format(position.unrealized_pnl_pct) }}%)
{% endif -%}
{% if position.thesis %}- **Thesis:** {{ position.thesis }}
{% endif %}
{% endif -%}
{% if closed -%}
## Realized results

**Total realized:** {{ realized | money(currency) }}

| Closed | Side | Qty | Entry | Exit | Fees | Net P&L | % | R |
|--------|------|-----|-------|------|------|---------|---|---|
{% for c in closed -%}
| {{ c.closed_at[:10] }} | {{ c.direction }} | {{ c.shares | num }} | {{ c.avg_entry_price | money(currency) }} | {{ c.avg_exit_price | money(currency) }} | {{ c.total_commission | money(currency) }} | {{ c.net_pnl | money(currency) }} | {{ "%.1f" | format(c.pnl_percent) }}% | {{ ("%.2f" | format(c.r_multiple)) if c.r_multiple is not none else "-" }} |
{% endfor %}
{% for c in closed if c.what_worked or c.what_failed or c.lesson -%}
### Review — {{ c.closed_at[:10] }}{% if c.rating %} ({{ c.rating }}/5){% endif %}

{% if c.what_worked %}- **Worked:** {{ c.what_worked }}
{% endif %}{% if c.what_failed %}- **Failed:** {{ c.what_failed }}
{% endif %}{% if c.lesson %}- **Lesson:** {{ c.lesson }}
{% endif %}
{% endfor -%}
{% endif -%}
## Fills

| # | Date | Action | Qty | Price | Commission | Notes |
|---|------|--------|-----|-------|------------|-------|
{% for t in fills -%}
| {{ t.id }} | {{ t.timestamp[:10] }} | {{ t.action }} | {{ t.shares | num }} | {{ t.price | money(t.currency) }} | {{ t.commission | money(t.currency) }} | {{ (t.notes or "") | replace("|", "/") | replace("\n", " ") }} |
{% endfor %}

